        "created_at": "2014-02-18T17:55:43.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>For what it's worth, I saw elements of the Emerald Dawn II storyline in there, with Jordan being near the end of his chances. Just missing the time in jail.</p><p>I disliked it for other reasons, which is a shame since Hal Jordan and Barry Allen are two of the few DC heroes I've every really enjoyed watching.</p>",
